   "act": 1,
   "title": "Deadhead",
   "text": "One ship, one loan, one empty hold. Haulers call that flying deadhead. Five systems are close enough to reach before you retire: Alpha, Beta, Gamma, Delta, Epsilon. Buy where it is cheap, sell where it is not, and keep up the payments.",
   "requires": {},
   "next": [
    "ch2a",
    "ch2b"
   ],
